name=Project Beefcake
id=ProjectBeefcake
description=This mod overhauls the food and cooking in zomboid!
description=It aims to vastly increase the meat from butchering and the calories of all meat items. 
description=It reduces the hunger of them to make vegetables with high hunger and low calories more useful to create balanced meals.
description=It fixes 2 vanilla bugs with butchering animals (The butchering hook bug and the 12~30 hour decay bug) as well as increases the amount of meat each animal produces when butchering.
description=Rabbits have had the calories of their meat reduced so as not to be so overpowered. 
description=Fish have been reduced in size and calorie count to be not so overpowered and easier to bring home. 
description=Cooking skill has been changed: You no longer use less hunger of an ingredient at higher cooking skill. Instead you always use the amount the UI says and the resulting recipe has more calories instead. 
description=It should be compatible with other cooking mods such as Sapph's cooking.

